1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:10,450
Hello guys welcome back to my youtube channel Safety Management Study
大家好，欢迎回到我的 YouTube 频道 Safety Management Study。

2
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:17,450
Guys today's video is about TLB, TWA, HTEL, IDLH
各位，今天的视频讲的是 TLV、TWA、STEL、IDLH。

3
00:00:17,450 --> 00:00:23,450
Today we will learn about TLB, TWA, HTEL, IDLH
今天我们来了解 TLV、TWA、STEL、IDLH。

4
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:25,450
So let's start today's video
那么我们开始今天的视频吧。

5
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:29,450
TLB i.e threshold limit value
TLV，即阈限值。

6
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:32,450
What is threshold limit value?
什么是阈限值？

7
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:34,450
So here is the definition
这里是定义：

8
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:37,450
The concentration of HTEL in the air
空气中有害物质的浓度，

9
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:41,450
in which worker can be exposed day after day for a working lifetime
工人在整个职业生涯中日复一日地暴露于该浓度下，

10
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:44,450
without adverse long-term or short-term health effect
不会产生长期或短期的不良健康影响。

11
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:48,450
i.e. in the air, the concentration of HTEL is so much
也就是说，空气中有害物质的浓度达到这样的程度：

12
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:51,450
that if the worker works his whole working life
工人即使在其中工作整个职业生涯，

13
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:56,450
then the long-term or short-term adverse health effect will not happen
也不会出现长期或短期的不良健康影响。

14
00:00:56,450 --> 00:01:00,450
Any gas, chemical or toxic substance's concentration
任何气体、化学品或有毒物质的浓度

15
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:04,450
is so much that the worker works his whole work life
达到这样的程度：工人在其中工作整个职业生涯，

16
00:01:04,450 --> 00:01:06,450
without any adverse health effect
也不会产生任何不良健康影响，

17
00:01:06,450 --> 00:01:10,450
So the concentration of that chemical will be TLB
那么这种化学品的这个浓度就是 TLV。

18
00:01:10,450 --> 00:01:14,450
Next, TWA, Time Weightage Average
接下来，TWA，时间加权平均值。

19
00:01:14,450 --> 00:01:17,450
So let's learn about TWA
我们来了解一下 TWA。

20
00:01:17,450 --> 00:01:20,450
The concentration of contaminant in the air
空气中污染物的浓度，

21
00:01:20,450 --> 00:01:24,450
in which workers can be exposed for 8 hours and 40 hours in a week
工人在该浓度下每天暴露 8 小时、每周 40 小时，

22
00:01:24,450 --> 00:01:27,450
without adverse long-term or short-term health effect
不会产生长期或短期的不良健康影响。

23
00:01:27,450 --> 00:01:30,450
i.e. in the air, the amount of contaminant and toxic substance
也就是说，空气中污染物和有毒物质的含量

24
00:01:30,450 --> 00:01:36,450
is so much that the worker works for 8 hours per day
达到这样的程度：工人每天工作 8 小时、

25
00:01:36,450 --> 00:01:38,450
and 40 hours in a week
每周工作 40 小时，

26
00:01:38,450 --> 00:01:41,450
and if he is exposed then there will be no adverse health effect
即使暴露其中也不会产生不良健康影响。

27
00:01:41,450 --> 00:01:44,450
i.e. any gas or chemical
也就是说，任何气体或化学品，

28
00:01:44,450 --> 00:01:47,450
concentration in which the worker can work 8 hours a day
工人在该浓度下可以每天工作 8 小时、

29
00:01:47,450 --> 00:01:50,450
and 40 hours in a week without any health effect
每周工作 40 小时而不受任何健康影响，

30
00:01:50,450 --> 00:01:53,450
we will talk about TWA of that chemical
我们就说这是该化学品的 TWA。

31
00:01:53,450 --> 00:01:56,450
i.e. if there is only 10 ppm of H2S in an environment
也就是说，如果某个环境中 H2S 只有 10 ppm，

32
00:01:56,450 --> 00:02:00,450
then any worker can work 8 hours in a day and 40 hours in a week
那么任何工人都可以每天工作 8 小时、每周工作 40 小时，

33
00:02:00,450 --> 00:02:03,450
without any adverse health effect
而不会产生任何不良健康影响，

34
00:02:03,450 --> 00:02:06,450
there will be no adverse effect and no damage
不会有不良影响，也不会有损害。

35
00:02:06,450 --> 00:02:10,450
So the 10 ppm of H2S is the TWA of that chemical
所以 H2S 的 10 ppm 就是这种化学品的 TWA。

36
00:02:10,450 --> 00:02:14,450
Next, STEL i.e. short-term exposure limit
接下来，STEL，即短时间接触限值。

37
00:02:14,450 --> 00:02:17,450
What is the short-term exposure limit?
什么是短时间接触限值？

38
00:02:17,450 --> 00:02:21,450
The minimum concentration of a chemical at which workers can be exposed
化学品的最低浓度，工人在该浓度下暴露

39
00:02:21,450 --> 00:02:25,450
for up to 15 minutes without adverse long-term or short-term health effect
最长 15 分钟，不会产生长期或短期的不良健康影响。

40
00:02:25,450 --> 00:02:31,450
i.e. any toxic gas or chemical
也就是说，任何有毒气体或化学品，

41
00:02:31,450 --> 00:02:34,450
concentration in which the worker can work for 15 minutes
工人在该浓度下可以工作 15 分钟

42
00:02:34,450 --> 00:02:36,450
without any adverse health effect
而不会产生任何不良健康影响，

43
00:02:36,450 --> 00:02:38,450
i.e. if the worker is working for 15 minutes
也就是说，如果工人工作 15 分钟，

44
00:02:38,450 --> 00:02:40,450
there will be no effect of that chemical
这种化学品不会对他产生影响，

45
00:02:40,450 --> 00:02:42,450
then that chemical will be called STEL
那么这种化学品的这个浓度就称为 STEL。

46
00:02:42,450 --> 00:02:45,450
The STEL of H2S is 15 ppm
H2S 的 STEL 是 15 ppm。

47
00:02:45,450 --> 00:02:48,450
If there is 15 ppm in any environment
如果某个环境中是 15 ppm，

48
00:02:48,450 --> 00:02:51,450
then you can work for 15 minutes
那么你可以工作 15 分钟，

49
00:02:51,450 --> 00:02:53,450
without any adverse health effect
而不会产生任何不良健康影响。

50
00:02:53,450 --> 00:02:57,450
Next, IDLH i.e. immediately dangerous to life and health
接下来，IDLH，即立即威胁生命和健康。

51
00:02:57,450 --> 00:03:00,450
So what is IDLH?
那么什么是 IDLH？

52
00:03:00,450 --> 00:03:04,450
The concentration of chemical or airborne contaminants
化学品或空气中污染物的浓度，

53
00:03:04,450 --> 00:03:06,450
at which if worker will be exposed
工人一旦暴露于该浓度下，

54
00:03:06,450 --> 00:03:09,450
then it will pose an immediate threat to life
就会对生命构成直接威胁。

55
00:03:09,450 --> 00:03:12,450
i.e. any chemical or airborne contaminants
也就是说，任何化学品或空气中污染物，

56
00:03:12,450 --> 00:03:15,450
the concentration in which the worker is exposed
工人暴露于该浓度下，

57
00:03:15,450 --> 00:03:18,450
if the worker works then his life can be damaged immediately
如果工人在其中工作，他的生命会立即受到危害，

58
00:03:18,450 --> 00:03:20,450
even death can happen
甚至可能死亡。

59
00:03:20,450 --> 00:03:22,450
i.e. workers in this condition
也就是说，在这种条件下，工人

60
00:03:22,450 --> 00:03:24,450
do not have to work in that environment
不应在该环境中工作。

61
00:03:24,450 --> 00:03:26,450
The IDLH of H2S is 100 ppm
H2S 的 IDLH 是 100 ppm。

62
00:03:26,450 --> 00:03:28,450
If in any environment
如果在任何环境中

63
00:03:28,450 --> 00:03:30,450
the IDLH of H2S is 100 ppm
H2S 达到 IDLH 的 100 ppm，

64
00:03:30,450 --> 00:03:33,450
then they cannot work there
那么他们就不能在那里工作，

65
00:03:33,450 --> 00:03:35,450
suddenly someone's death can happen
可能会有人突然死亡，

66
00:03:35,450 --> 00:03:37,450
and anyone's life can be damaged
任何人的生命都可能受到危害。

67
00:03:37,450 --> 00:03:41,450
I hope you understood what is TLB, TWA, STEL, IDLH
希望你已经理解了什么是 TLV、TWA、STEL、IDLH。

68
00:03:41,450 --> 00:03:43,450
If you understood then like the video
如果你理解了，请给视频点赞，

69
00:03:43,450 --> 00:03:45,450
subscribe to the channel
并订阅频道。

70
00:03:45,450 --> 00:03:47,450
thank you for watching
感谢观看。
